    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "FID values are distances from original SD outputs, so SD1.4 has no FID baseline; the reader misassigned 16.64 as the baseline throughout. Superposition is invoked only as motivation. No uncertainty estimates are reported. The coupling analysis reflects SAE encoder/decoder non-orthogonality more than the model's own representation."
